    Unify the plotting code and restyle the plots
    
    - saveplots.py: one draw() function for the plane and Mollweide maps of
      plot_all and plot_1, LaTeX fonts (latex_fonts, with a fallback when LaTeX
      is not installed), symmetric color scales for signed magnitudes, color
      bars ending in triangles without overlapping end ticks, optional titles,
      and a bottom color bar option for the movies
